/* RetroArch's names for keyboard keys: the name a config file writes for a
 * key and reads back as it, through input_config_translate_str_to_rk.
 * input_keymaps.c builds input_config_key_map from this list, in this order.
 * A key named twice is written by its first name and read by either; nul
 * names no key. A single letter names its own key and is not listed here.
 *
 * ROM-in-a-Box's exporter reads this file (desktop/src-tauri/src/controls.rs)
 * to decide which names a binding may use.
 *
 * RIB_KEY_NAME("name", RETROK_key) */

